    "Triple-click the same button, enter your passcode and tap **End**." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Access guide, step 5 detail. **End** is the button on the iOS Guided Access screen that ends the session; use Apple's localized label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "am" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ያንኑ ቁልፍ ሦስት ጊዜ ይጫኑ፣ የይለፍ ኮድዎን ያስገቡ እና **አብቃ** (End) የሚለውን መታ ያድርጉ።"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اضغط ثلاث مرات على الزر نفسه، وأدخل رمز الدخول، ثم اضغط على **إنهاء**."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třikrát stiskni stejné tlačítko, zadej kód a klepni na **Ukončit**."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drück dieselbe Taste dreimal, gib deinen Code ein und tippe auf **Beenden**."
